---
---
<!-- ── CUSTOM APPS ── -->
<section class="apps-section" id="custom-apps">
  <div class="apps-inner">

    <div>
      <div class="stag-b">Custom Business Applications</div>
      <h2 class="sh-b">Your whole operation.<br/><em>One app.</em></h2>
      <p class="sb-b">Most businesses manage their tech through a dozen disconnected dashboards. We build you a single, white-labeled app that ties everything HowdyNET manages into one clean interface — on your phone, your tablet, your front desk screen.</p>
      <p class="sb-b" style="margin-bottom:36px;">No off-the-shelf software. Built for your specific systems, your team, your workflows. When something needs attention, you see it. When everything's running clean, you see that too.</p>

      <!-- App mockup -->
      <div class="app-mockup">
        <div class="app-screen">
          <div class="app-screen-bar">
            <div class="app-screen-dot" style="background:#ef4444;"></div>
            <div class="app-screen-dot" style="background:#facc15;"></div>
            <div class="app-screen-dot" style="background:#22c55e;"></div>
            <div class="app-screen-title">YourBusiness — Powered by HowdyNET</div>
          </div>
          <div class="app-tiles">
            <div class="app-tile">
              <div class="app-tile-icon">📷</div>
              <div class="app-tile-label">Cameras</div>
              <div class="app-tile-val" style="color:#22c55e;">● Live</div>
            </div>
            <div class="app-tile">
              <div class="app-tile-icon">🔒</div>
              <div class="app-tile-label">Door Access</div>
              <div class="app-tile-val" style="color:#22c55e;">Secured</div>
            </div>
            <div class="app-tile">
              <div class="app-tile-icon">📡</div>
              <div class="app-tile-label">Network</div>
              <div class="app-tile-val" style="color:#22c55e;">94/100</div>
            </div>
            <div class="app-tile">
              <div class="app-tile-icon">🖥️</div>
              <div class="app-tile-label">Displays</div>
              <div class="app-tile-val" style="color:#22c55e;">4 Online</div>
            </div>
            <div class="app-tile">
              <div class="app-tile-icon">🛡️</div>
              <div class="app-tile-label">Threats Blocked</div>
              <div class="app-tile-val" style="color:#facc15;">847 today</div>
            </div>
            <div class="app-tile">
              <div class="app-tile-icon">🎫</div>
              <div class="app-tile-label">Support</div>
              <div class="app-tile-val" style="color:#6EC6F0;">0 open</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div style="text-align:center;margin-top:12px;font-size:0.65rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.2);font-weight:400;">White-labeled for your business · iOS & Android · Web dashboard</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="apps-features">
      <div class="app-feat">
        <div class="app-feat-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#1A9FE0" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M15 12a3 3 0 1 1-6 0 3 3 0 0 1 6 0z"/><path d="M2.458 12C3.732 7.943 7.523 5 12 5c4.478 0 8.268 2.943 9.542 7-1.274 4.057-5.064 7-9.542 7-4.477 0-8.268-2.943-9.542-7z"/></svg></div>
        <div>
          <h3>Live Camera Feeds</h3>
          <p>Every camera HowdyNET manages, in your pocket. View live feeds, review recordings, and get motion alerts — all from one app, anywhere in the world.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="app-feat">
        <div class="app-feat-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#1A9FE0" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"><rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2"/><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"/></svg></div>
        <div>
          <h3>Door Access & Entry Control</h3>
          <p>Grant or revoke access, see who came in and when, unlock doors remotely. Your access control system in the palm of your hand.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="app-feat">
        <div class="app-feat-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#1A9FE0" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M22 12h-4l-3 9L9 3l-3 9H2"/></svg></div>
        <div>
          <h3>Network Health Dashboard</h3>
          <p>Real-time quality score, connected devices, bandwidth usage, threats blocked. See exactly what's happening on your network — in plain English, not IT jargon.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="app-feat">
        <div class="app-feat-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#1A9FE0" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"><rect x="2" y="3" width="20" height="14" rx="2"/><path d="M8 21h8M12 17v4"/></svg></div>
        <div>
          <h3>Display Content Management</h3>
          <p>Push content to your LED walls and digital signage from anywhere. Update your menu board before service, change your lobby display remotely, schedule content by time of day.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="app-feat">
        <div class="app-feat-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#1A9FE0" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/></svg></div>
        <div>
          <h3>Support & Service Requests</h3>
          <p>Something needs attention? Open a ticket, attach a photo, and reach HowdyNET directly — all inside the same app. No switching between systems.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="app-feat">
        <div class="app-feat-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#1A9FE0" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/><path d="M19.07 4.93a10 10 0 0 1 0 14.14M4.93 4.93a10 10 0 0 0 0 14.14"/></svg></div>
        <div>
          <h3>Built for Your Business</h3>
          <p>White-labeled with your brand. Configured for your specific systems. Works on iOS, Android, and web. One interface that makes you look like you have an enterprise IT team — because you do.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <a href="#contact" class="btn-panel btn-blue" style="max-width:100%;margin-top:8px;display:block;text-align:center;text-decoration:none;">Let's Build Your App →</a>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
